# ==============================================================================
# Multi-Calendar Configuration for Quickshell ClockPanel
# Copy this file to: ~/.config/quickshell/calendars.conf
# Note: ~/.config/quickshell/calendars.conf is ignored by git to keep your URLs private.
# ==============================================================================
#
# Format:
# Calendar Name | Hex Color | Secret iCal URL
#
# How to get your Google Calendar secret iCal URL:
# 1. Open https://calendar.google.com
# 2. Go to Settings -> "Settings for my calendars" -> click a calendar
# 3. Scroll down to "Integrate calendar" section
# 4. Copy "Secret address in iCal format" (starts with https://calendar.google.com/calendar/ical/...)
#
# Examples:
Personal      | #47c8ff | https://calendar.google.com/calendar/ical/your_email%40gmail.com/private-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx/basic.ics
Classes       | #a78bfa | https://calendar.google.com/calendar/ical/example_class%40group.calendar.google.com/private-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx/basic.ics
Holidays      | #34d399 | https://calendar.google.com/calendar/ical/en.indian%23holiday%40group.v.calendar.google.com/public/basic.ics
Events        | #f472b6 | https://calendar.google.com/calendar/ical/example_events%40group.calendar.google.com/private-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx/basic.ics
Anniversaries | #fbbf24 | https://calendar.google.com/calendar/ical/example_anniv%40group.calendar.google.com/private-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx/basic.ics

